  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AB Ronneby Industrifastigheter (ABRI) purchased and donated electric power plant to the city Ternopil in Ukraine, as a part of their partnership exchange/twinning association. The twinning association transported the generators to Ukraine and several of Ronneby municipality&apos;s politicians participate in that work. This ensures that the aid reaches the right place and receives the intended.</narrative>
